te","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though Takaomi is usually laying sick in his bed, he is still respected as the head of his family, and his words are considered absolute. Takaomi's wife, Sumi, and his loyal butler, Yaku Shuugo, are always by his side, acting as interpreters for him, as the head of the family cannot speak clearly. Due to being is prone to illness and suffering a terrible accident, Kiriya Takaomi always uses a wheelchair, wears a mask to hide burn scars."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Erogamescape."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c119349"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"病がちで常に車椅子に乗り、過去に負った火傷の傷跡を隠すためと称して仮面を付け素顔を隠す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隆臣の側にはいつも夫人の澄美と執事の夜久周吾がおり、満足に話が出来ない当主の通訳をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病床の身となった今でも当主として敬われ、彼の言葉は絶対とされる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12487","sourceWorkId":"13702","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"病がちで常に車椅子に乗り、過去に負った火傷の傷跡を隠すためと称して仮面を付け素顔を隠す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隆臣の側にはいつも夫人の澄美と執事の夜久周吾がおり、満足に話が出来ない当主の通訳をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病床の身となった今でも当主として敬われ、彼の言葉は絶対とされる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90300"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9862fd60cfaaba1afbe4b0599f31c23df9ffe04f24c44cb4e506b6672438d18.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68ba772779d73e7c1147fab0383a8e42e0d01787e864ccc6caa853dea4f1cdf0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"広末涼","creatorId":"vndb:s1254","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1254","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1254","name":"広末 涼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21237:90300:49377:1","source":"bangu